==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Knuckles (Enemy)|Knuckles]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is simple enough, use rushers like [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe Cat]], [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]], or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to easily beat this stage. [[Cat Combo]]s like [[Cool Japan (Combo)|Cool Japan]] will help a bit as well.

